All 8 abstract methods defined in "GraphProvider" are fully implemented in "SCKGGraphProvider":


Format: | Function | Purpose | Input | Output |
| `resolve_symptom` | Maps runtime errors/stack traces to graph nodes | `TelemetryEvent` | `list[CodeNode]` |
| `backward_traverse` | Walks dependencies backward to rank root causes | `CodeNode`, `TraversalPolicy` | `list[CandidateRootCause]` |
| `forward_traverse` | Computes downstream blast radius for agent context | `CodeNode`, `TraversalPolicy` | `InducedSubgraph` |
| `get_contract_between` | Finds shared APIs/topics between two services | `service_a: str`, `service_b: str` | `list[CodeNode]` |
| `explain_path` | Generates causal explanation chain between two nodes | `node_a: CodeNode`, `node_b: CodeNode` | `CausalPath` |
| `find_node_by_name` | Discovers nodes by symbol name with fuzzy fallback | `name: str`, `file_path: str?` | `list[CodeNode]` |
| `get_node_detail` | Retrieves complete code snippet, AST lines & metadata | `node_id: str` | `CodeNode` |
| `version` | Logs engine version for reproducibility | None | `str` (`"GRAFT-CKG/1.0.0"`) |


E.g Use Cases (Note: These are generated):

from contracts.graph_types import TelemetryEvent, TraversalPolicy
from sckg_provider import SCKGGraphProvider

# 1. Initialize the Provider (Builds the multi-repo graph)
provider = SCKGGraphProvider("workspace.yaml")  # or directory path

# 2. version() -> str
engine_ver = provider.version()
print(f"Engine Version: {engine_ver}")

# 3. resolve_symptom(symptom: TelemetryEvent) -> list[CodeNode]
event = TelemetryEvent(
    event_id="evt-404",
    service_name="order_service",
    error_type="gRPC_UNAVAILABLE",
    message="RPC timeout calling PaymentService.Charge",
    stack_trace="order_service/service.py:process_order:52",
)
symptom_nodes = provider.resolve_symptom(event)
primary_symptom = symptom_nodes[0]
print(
    f"Symptom mapped to: {primary_symptom.short_label()} in {primary_symptom.file_path}"
)

# 4. backward_traverse(node: CodeNode, policy: TraversalPolicy) -> list[CandidateRootCause]
policy = TraversalPolicy(max_depth=3, max_nodes=20)
candidates = provider.backward_traverse(primary_symptom, policy=policy)
for c in candidates:
    print(
        f"Rank #{c.rank}: {c.node.short_label()} (Confidence: {c.confidence:.2f})"
    )
    print(f"  Evidence: {c.evidence}")

# 5. forward_traverse(node: CodeNode, policy: TraversalPolicy) -> InducedSubgraph
blast_subgraph = provider.forward_traverse(primary_symptom, policy=policy)
print(f"Affected Services: {blast_subgraph.services_affected}")
print(f"Estimated Tokens: {blast_subgraph.estimated_tokens()}")
prompt_context = blast_subgraph.to_prompt_context(strategy="full_source")

# 6. get_contract_between(service_a: str, service_b: str) -> list[CodeNode]
shared_contracts = provider.get_contract_between(
    "order_service", "payment_service"
)
for contract in shared_contracts:
    print(
        f"Shared Contract: {contract.name} (Type: {contract.node_type.value})"
    )

# 7. explain_path(node_a: CodeNode, node_b: CodeNode) -> CausalPath
causal_chain = provider.explain_path(candidates[0].node, primary_symptom)
print("Causal Propagation Narrative:")
print(causal_chain.to_narrative())

# 8. find_node_by_name(name: str, file_path: str | None = None) -> list[CodeNode]
matching_nodes = provider.find_node_by_name(
    "process_order", file_path="order_service/service.py"
)
for node in matching_nodes:
    print(f"Found node: {node.node_id} (Type: {node.node_type.value})")

# 9. get_node_detail(node_id: str) -> CodeNode
node_detail = provider.get_node_detail(primary_symptom.node_id)
print(f"Node Signature: {node_detail.signature}")
print(f"Source Snippet:\n{node_detail.source_snippet}")
